      "message": "Looks like it\u0027s ChangeJson expected behavior: 105396: ChangeJson: Don\u0027t set isPrivate and workInProgress if value is false | https://gerrit-review.googlesource.com/c/gerrit/+/105396\nand you can see in the rest api doc a bunch of fields that say \"not set if `false`\": https://gerrit-review.googlesource.com/Documentation/rest-api-changes.html#change-info\n\nYou can also see where toBoolean was added and how it was just adding a helper for existing behavior checking for true: https://gerrit-review.googlesource.com/c/gerrit/+/413568/1/java/com/google/gerrit/server/change/ChangeJson.java",
